  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mbugwe Sunflower Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Sunflower. Beneficiaries: More than 1,400 smallholder farmers, input suppliers, processors and cooperative members will directly and indirectly through increased income, employment and livelihoods. Description: This is a sunflower value chain proposition that will involve more than 1,550 direct and indirect beneficiaries. The edible oil processors will have access to reliable supply of high quality sunflower seeds for processing into high quality sunflower cooking oil and by products such as sunflower cake for the animal feeds market.</narrative>
  </description>
